      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003E153. To make an AMBLET of COCKLES.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake four whites and two yolks of eggs, a pint of cream, a little flour, a nutmeg grated, a little salt, and a jill of cockles, mix all together, and fry it brown.\u003Cbr\u003E\nThis is proper for a side-dish either for noon or night.\u003Cbr\u003E"
